                        "id":  "roaring-wyrm",
                        "title":  "The Roaring Wyrm",
                        "category":  "Creatures",
                        "summary":  "A colossal dragon-like being of stone and flesh darkens the sky and guards centuries of plundered airship treasure.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The Roaring Wyrm is large enough to partly block the sun. Its voice churns the wind and tears apart nearby clouds, announcing the creature before travelers can see its full scale.",
                                     "Its hoard is assembled from dozens of fallen vessels, turning its territory into both a graveyard and one of the skies\u0027 most dangerous treasure sites."
                                 ],
