                        "id":  "sky-leviathans-wake",
                        "title":  "Sky Leviathan\u0027s Wake",
                        "category":  "Encounters",
                        "summary":  "Debris, decay, and mutated scavengers mark the recent passage or death of an enormous sky leviathan.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The wake contains wreckage and the lingering smell of decay. Large fish-like creatures once hunted by the leviathan now circle the debris in search of new prey.",
                                     "Travelers may find salvage or biological remains, but entering the field exposes them to hungry scavengers and uncertainty about whether the leviathan is truly gone."
                                 ],
