                        "id":  "abyssal-rift",
                        "title":  "The Abyssal Rift",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "A tear in the clouds distorts gravity around unstable islands and exposes dangerous magical energy near the Abyss.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Light fades and the air grows cold toward the rift. Small islands hang precariously around its edge while falling objects and creatures are drawn into a depth from which none are known to return.",
                                     "Power can be harvested near the boundary, encouraging desperate expeditions despite unstable gravity and the proximity of [[the-abyss|the Abyss]]."
                                 ],
