                        "category":  "Factions",
                        "summary":  "Red-sailed sky pirates ambush isolated travelers with magical harpoons and wind magic.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The Bloodwind Marauders fly blackened flags beneath red sails and prefer lone or vulnerable targets. Their attacks are designed to stop escape and force a rapid boarding.",
                                     "Magical harpoons hold vessels in place while wind-working raiders close the distance and seize whatever cargo, supplies, or captives they can carry."
