                        "body":  [
                                     "Lightning and violent winds form a storm wall dangerous even to heavily built vessels. Reports identify a thunderbird or storm giant within the heart of the disturbance, its movements sustaining the tempest.",
                                     "Crossing the storm requires confronting both environmental destruction and the possibility that its central being may notice or pursue intruders."
