                        "title":  "Fallen Star",
                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "A celestial impact draws competing sky and undercloud creatures to valuable otherworldly material.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The burning stone sends shockwaves through the surrounding air before striking a floating landmass or vanishing into lower cloud. Its impact zone quickly becomes visible across nearby routes.",
                                     "Scavengers descend from above and rise from beneath the clouds, turning recovery of celestial resources into a contested and rapidly changing battlefield."
                                 ],
