                        "category":  "Creatures",
                        "summary":  "Mist-like spirits seek strong magical auras and drain vitality from living beings and vessels caught in their wake.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Aether Wraiths resemble ghostly forms built from fog and swirling magical energy. Powerful enchanted objects, active spells, and magical propulsion can draw them toward a ship.",
                                     "They attempt possession or life-draining contact, while vessels lingering near them seem to lose energy and liveliness along with their crews."
