                        "category":  "Locations",
                        "summary":  "An immense tangle of enchanted chains hangs from the clouds and leads toward a forgotten guarded city.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The chains remain suspended by the remnants of a dead celestial force. Their paths form both a navigational landmark and a physical route through otherwise open sky.",
                                     "Following them leads to an ancient city whose treasures are protected by corrupted winged beasts, raising questions about the celestial power that once anchored the structure."
