                        "title":  "The Bloodfog",
                        "category":  "Hazards",
                        "summary":  "A living crimson fog consumes what it overtakes and conceals aberrant predators within its decay-laden depths.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The Bloodfog moves across the sky as a coherent mass rather than ordinary weather. Its color and smell announce it, but its breadth can leave vessels with few escape routes.",
                                     "Nightmarish creatures hunt inside the fog and attack travelers who penetrate too deeply, while the fog itself appears to consume objects and living beings in its path."
